SDL_mixer: MIDI music through riscos-midisynth (RISC OS)

RISC OS has no General MIDI synthesiser, so SDL_mixer's MIDI music needs
a software one. This adds a music decoder, MUSIC_MID_MIDISYNTH, that plays
MIDI files with riscos-midisynth (TinySoundFont), the library the OpenTTD
port already uses. configure compiles every src/codecs/*.c, so it needs no
build-system change: build with
  CFLAGS += -DMUSIC_MID -DMUSIC_MID_MIDISYNTH  and link -lmidisynth.
SoundFont: Mix_SetSoundFonts() (first entry), else midisynth's default
(MIDISynth$SoundFont). No seeking.

--- a/src/codecs/music_midisynth.c
+++ b/src/codecs/music_midisynth.c
@@ -0,0 +1,366 @@
